            "answer": "<p>Yes. YAZ & Co provides a ring size guide and conversion chart to assist customers in selecting the correct size before purchase.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8RRJJW": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I order on YAZ & Co?",
            "answer": "<p>Customers may place orders directly through the official YAZ & Co website by selecting their preferred items and completing checkout using an approved payment method. Orders are confirmed once full payment has been successfully received and verified.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_KPHXJr": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is my YAZ & Co item packaged?",
            "answer": "<p>Each YAZ & Co piece arrives in a signature YAZ & Co presentation box and is carefully packed to ensure safe delivery. Orders may also include a branded shopping bag, authenticator card, and protective packaging.</p>"
