        },
        "faq_item_DeazX4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there VAT charged online, and can I claim it back?",
            "answer": "<p>VAT is charged in accordance with UAE laws and regulations. Tax refund eligibility, where applicable, is subject to UAE government regulations and approved tax refund procedures.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_KcUcrp": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the YAZ & Co Box available for purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>The YAZ & Co presentation box is provided exclusively with the purchase of YAZ & Co jewellery and is not sold separately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4BxiFP": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Discover New Ways to Shop",
            "answer": "<p>Customers may contact YAZ & Co for private consultations, online assistance, product inquiries, and personalized support. Appointments may also be arranged for private visits subject to availability and confirmation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_JQYhkr": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Mastercard® SecureCode™?",
            "answer": "<p>Mastercard® SecureCode™ is a security service provided by Mastercard and participating card issuers to help protect online purchases from unauthorized use. Customers may be required to complete additional identity verification during checkout.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_HYdDpx": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Verified by Visa?",
            "answer": "<p>Verified by Visa is a security feature designed to help protect Visa cardholders during online transactions. Additional verification may be requested by the card issuer during payment processing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Cnadxf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What payment methods does YAZ & Co accept?",
            "answer": "<p>YAZ & Co accepts approved payment methods available at checkout, which may include:</p><ul><li>Apple Pay</li><li>Google Pay</li><li>Visa</li><li>Mastercard</li></ul><p>Available payment methods may vary depending on location and platform.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_WYgKfH": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is YAZ & Co doing with my information to comply with privacy and data protection regulations?",
            "answer": "<p>YAZ & Co is committed to protecting customer privacy and handling personal information responsibly. Customer data is used solely for order processing, communication, and related services in accordance with our Privacy Policy. Personal information is not sold or rented to third parties.</p>"
          }
        },
        "category_P3pK8L": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Care",
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7A46Cf": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can my YAZ &Co jewelry get wet?",
            "answer": "<p>While YAZ & Co diamond jewellery can tolerate occasional exposure to water, we recommend removing your jewellery before activities that may affect its brilliance, finish, or longevity.</p><p>This includes:</p><ul><li>Showering, bathing, or swimming</li><li>Using perfumes, lotions, or cosmetics</li><li>Exercising or contact sports</li><li>Household cleaning or outdoor work</li><li>Exposure to chlorine, salt water, or harsh chemicals</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_NXH4xN": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does gold tarnish?",
            "answer": "<p>18k gold jewellery may naturally develop minor scratches or changes in surface appearance over time due to daily wear. To preserve the brilliance and finish of your YAZ & Co diamond jewellery, avoid exposure to chemicals, bleach, perfumes, cleaning products, and excessive moisture.</p><p>When not being worn, store your jewellery safely in its original YAZ & Co box or protective pouch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_BCVicM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does YAZ & Co offer a jewellery cleaning service? Can I get my YAZ & Co jewellery cleaned?",
            "answer": "<p>Selected cleaning and maintenance services may be available upon evaluation by YAZ & Co. Service availability depends on the jewellery condition and design.</p><p>Customers may contact YAZ & Co customer service regarding jewellery care and servicing requests.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Lz3hjY": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does YAZ & Co offer free jewellery cleaning services?",
            "answer": "<p>Basic cleaning services may be provided for selected YAZ & Co diamond jewellery pieces at the discretion of the company. Additional polishing, repair, resizing, or maintenance services may involve service charges depending on the required work.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_jrNmJD": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I care for my diamond jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>To preserve the brilliance of your diamond jewellery, avoid direct contact with chemicals, perfumes, cosmetics, lotions, and abrasive surfaces. Jewellery should be cleaned gently using a soft cloth and stored separately to avoid scratches or damage.</p><p>We recommend periodic professional inspection and maintenance for jewellery worn frequently.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_WQxtfK": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I clean my diamond ring?",
            "answer": "<p>Diamond jewellery may be cleaned gently using lukewarm water, mild soap, and a soft brush or cloth. Avoid abrasive cleaning products or harsh chemicals. Ensure the jewellery is fully dried before storage.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_GT9KXg": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I store & organize my jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>Diamond jewellery should be stored separately to avoid scratches, tangling, or damage between pieces. We recommend using protective boxes, pouches, or compartments and keeping jewellery away from moisture, heat, direct sunlight, and chemicals.</p><p>When travelling, jewellery should be securely packed and protected individually. Valuable pieces should remain with the owner whenever possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_gFz9Xb": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I care for my gemstone jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>YAZ & Co jewellery is crafted using lab-grown diamonds and fine materials that require careful handling to preserve their brilliance and condition. Avoid impact against hard surfaces, exposure to chemicals, perfumes, cosmetics, ultrasonic cleaning, and extreme temperatures.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_paU8UX": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How to polish gold and diamond jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>Gold jewellery polishing should only be performed by qualified professionals to avoid unnecessary metal wear or surface damage.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_DKTkXJ": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How to remove scratches from gold jewellery?",
            "answer": "<p>Minor scratches naturally develop over time through regular wear. Professional polishing may help reduce the appearance of scratches; however, excessive polishing is not recommended as it gradually removes metal from the jewellery surface.</p>"
          }
        },
